e</strong></li></ol><p id="55fa" class="pw-post-body-paragraph na nb hs nc b nd ne nf ng nh ni nj nk nl nm nn no np nq nr ns nt nu nv nw nx hl bl">In multilevel inheritance, a class inherits from a parent class, and another class inherits</p><p id="8dc1" class="pw-post-body-paragraph na nb hs nc b nd ne nf ng nh ni nj nk nl nm nn no np nq nr ns nt nu nv nw nx hl bl">from this child class, forming a chain.</p><figure class="oj ok ol om on oo og oh paragraph-image"><div role="button" tabindex="0" class="op oq fz or bi os"><span class="ge gf gg ao gh gi gj fs gk speechify-ignore">Press enter or click to view image in full size</span><div class="og oh oi"><picture><source srcset="https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:640/format:webp/0*uFjsuiL9rGtPVyqM 640w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:720/format:webp/0*uFjsuiL9rGtPVyqM 720w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:750/format:webp/0*uFjsuiL9rGtPVyqM 750w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:786/format:webp/0*uFjsuiL9rGtPVyqM 786w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:828/format:webp/0*uFjsuiL9rGtPVyqM 828w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1100/format:webp/0*uFjsuiL9rGtPVyqM 1100w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/format:webp/0*uFjsuiL9rGtPVyqM 1400w" sizes="(min-resolution: 4dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 4) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (min-resolution: 3dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 67vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 3) and (max-width: 700px) 65vw, (min-resolution: 2.5dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2.5) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (min-resolution: 2dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" type="image/webp"><source data-testid="og" srcset="https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:640/0*uFjsuiL9rGtPVyqM 640w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:720/0*uFjsuiL9rGtPVyqM 720w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:750/0*uFjsuiL9rGtPVyqM 750w, https://miro.m